1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:02,420
(Sheldon:)Did I say Mars Rover?

2
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:03,420
(Leonard:)You did.

3
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:05,760
(Sheldon:)That was actually
a poorly chosen example,

4
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:08,490
(Sheldon:)as it had nothing
to do with me.

5
00:00:08,490 --> 00:00:11,160
(Page:)Yes, well, let's talk
about it anyway.

6
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:12,660
(Raj:)I don't want to.

7
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:14,870
(Sheldon:)Not that my disinclination

8
00:00:14,870 --> 00:00:16,900
(Sheldon:)to discuss the topic
should be interpreted as

9
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:19,470
(Sheldon:)evidence of Howard Wolowitz's
culpability in the destruction

10
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:22,510
(Sheldon:)of government property
worth millions of dollars.

11
00:00:22,510 --> 00:00:23,770
(Page:)Thank you, Dr. Cooper.

12
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:25,380
(Page:)I think I have all I need.

13
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:27,140
(Sheldon:)Oh, good.

14
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:28,860
(Sheldon:)I was afraid you were
going to fixate

15
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:30,480
(Sheldon:)on that Mars Rover incident.

16
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:38,360
(Howard:)Hey, buddies.

17
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:39,570
(Howard:)Guess who didn't get
security clearance

18
00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:41,190
(Howard:)to work on
the giant space laser?

19
00:00:41,190 --> 00:00:42,990
(Leonard:)What happened?

20
00:00:42,990 --> 00:00:45,160
(Howard:)Apparently, the background
interviews didn't go well.

21
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:46,500
(Howard:)You guys wouldn't
know anything

22
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:48,130
(Howard:)about that, would you?

23
00:00:49,870 --> 00:00:51,600
(Raj:)Well, actually,
I may have gotten

24
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:53,800
(Raj:)a little tipsy
when I talked to her.

25
00:00:54,510 --> 00:00:55,540
(Leonard:)And I may have

26
00:00:55,540 --> 00:00:57,310
(Leonard:)hit on her a little bit.

27
00:00:57,310 --> 00:01:00,840
(Raj:)I may have thrown up
rum cake on her shoes.

